### Before or After Making Changes

Use one capable reviewer by default. Request a second independent review only
when a trust-boundary change, destructive behavior, broad compatibility or
deployment impact, unresolved uncertainty, or genuinely independent
codebase-wide tracks are present. Record the reason and the escalated review
mode in the report; counts alone never escalate.

